Journey: Clean journey
Id: clean
Tags: @regression @orders
Role: manager
Variables: password=${PASSWORD}

Log in as manager
Open /orders/new
Select "Gadget (49.50)" from the Product dropdown
Type "2" into the Quantity field
Click the "Submit order" button
  Expect the page contains "created"
Wait for the text "Order created"
Click testid=download-invoice
  Expect the page contains "Invoice"
